msgid ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin detected. LF is deferring the base OG set "
"to the mu-plugin and outputting og:locale + og:locale:alternate only. You "
"can deactivate the mu-plugin — LF's built-in Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share tab) and Open Graph cover the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Legacy lf-social-share mu-plugin gedetecteerd. LF stelt de basis OG-set uit "
"naar de mu-plugin en geeft alleen og:locale + og:locale:alternate weer. Je "
"kunt de mu-plugin deactiveren — LF's ingebouwde Social Share (SEO → Social "
"Share-tab) en Open Graph dekken dezelfde functionaliteit."

