msgstr "Genereer de meertalige sitemap op /lf-sitemap.xml"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:110
msgid ""
"When enabled, the sitemap URL is announced in robots.txt automatically and "
"the cache is refreshed when translated content is saved."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingeschakeld, wordt de sitemap-URL automatisch aangekondigd in "
"robots.txt en wordt de cache vernieuwd wanneer vertaalde inhoud wordt "
"opgeslagen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:118
