msgid "Save Sitemap Settings"
msgstr "Opslaan Sitemap-instellingen"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:182
msgid "Flush Sitemap Cache"
msgstr "Sitemap-cache legen"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:184
msgid ""
"Forces the sitemap to regenerate on the next request. Use after bulk-"
"importing or manually editing translation relationships."
msgstr ""
"Forceert dat de sitemap bij de volgende aanvraag wordt hergenereerd. Gebruik "
"na bulk-import of handmatige bewerking van vertaalrelaties."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:190
msgid "IndexNow"
msgstr "IndexNow"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:194
msgid ""
"IndexNow is an open protocol supported by Bing, Yandex, and other search "
"engines. When a translated post is published or updated, Lingua Forge "
"automatically notifies all participating engines in a single push — no "
"polling, no waiting for the next robots.txt crawl."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow is een open protocol dat wordt ondersteund door Bing, Yandex en "
"andere zoekmachines. Wanneer een vertaald bericht wordt gepubliceerd of "
"bijgewerkt, informeert Lingua Forge automatisch alle deelnemende engines in "
"één push — geen polling, geen wachten op de volgende robots.txt-crawl."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:202
msgid ""
"IndexNow replaces the deprecated Bing and Yandex sitemap-ping endpoints. "
"Google discovers sitemaps via the robots.txt Sitemap: directive as before."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow vervangt de verouderde Bing- en Yandex-sitemap-ping endpoints. "
"Google ontdekt sitemaps via de robots.txt Sitemap: directive zoals voorheen."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:219
msgid "✓ All URLs submitted to IndexNow successfully."
msgstr "✓ Alle URL's succesvol ingediend bij IndexNow."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:223
msgid ""
"No translated URLs found to submit. Publish some translated posts first."
msgstr ""
"Geen vertaalde URL's gevonden om in te dienen. Publiceer eerst enkele "
"vertaalde berichten."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:227
msgid ""
"✗ IndexNow submission failed. Check that the key file is publicly reachable "
